    <selectionEntry id="f851-9166-e134-2d28" name="Night Scythe (Homebrew)" hidden="true" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <comment>7th Ed rules and VDR (ignoring some of restrictions put in place for Necrons by CA2004)

Flyer-Normal
Armor - 11-11-11 = 5+30+20=55
Flyer=40

Living Metal=50
Tesla Destructor=50 (based on some analysis this appears to be worth 50 points compared to any autocannon after considering Tesla)</comment>
      <modifiers>
        </modifiers>
      <rules>
        <rule id="e53e-89e3-d356-011f" name="Living Metal" hidden="false">
          <description>Attacks which count the target's Armor Value as being less than it really is do not do so against the Monolith. Similarly, weapons that get additional Armor Penetration dice do not get the extra dice against the Monolith. Ordnance weapons still roll 2D6 and select the highest.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="9088-768c-429a-a204" name="Night Scythe" hidden="false" targetId="f92d-3a3c-4025-befc" type="profile" />
