      <rules>
        <rule id="aac5-63cf-af14-3f36-d6d91" name="Gaze of Death" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>In its Shooting phase, in addition to using Powers of the C'tan, this model can target one non-vehicle enemy unit within 12" to which it has line of sight. The unit suffers a number of Wounds equal to 3D6 minus its Leadership, resolved at AP2 and with the Ignores Cover special rule. If at least one unsaved Wound is inflicted, the C'tan Shard of the Nightbringer immediately regains one Wound lost earlier in the battle.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
