          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="db71-0111-7824-d1c8-d6d91" name="Command Wave" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>All friendly units with the Necrons Faction within 12" of a Catacomb Command Barge re-roll all failed Morale, Pinning and Fear tests. If your Warlord is a Catacomb Command Barge with the Immortal Hubris Warlord Trait, this special rule instead effects all friendly units with the Necrons faction within 18" of your Warlord.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
