          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="f849-8ff4-a0ef-6bef-d6d91" name="The Stars Are Right" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Roll a D6 at the start of each friendly turn. If the result is less than the current turn number, Orikan uses the Orikan Empowered profile for the rest of the game. If Orikan suffered an unsaved Wound before becoming empowered, he will have 3 Wounds instead of 4.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="eeb2-991e-3957-2d87-d6d91" name="Master Chronomancer" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Orikan and all models with the Reanimation Protocols special rule in his unit receive a +1 bonus to Reanimation Protocols rolls and can re-roll saving throws of a 1.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
