            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When fighting in a challenge, a model with mindshackle scarabs has the Fear special rule. Fear tests taken as a result of mindshackle scarabs must be taken on 3D6.</characteristic>
